b.org/t/p/original/vDR2h5uQNgWyx3fsEVnEOcNFibZ.jpg\",\"rating\":7.6,\"year\":2021,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Sara is a teen girl who is looking forward to her 18th birthday to move away from her controlling father Don. But before she could even blow out the candles, Don imprisons her in the basement of their home.\",\"genres\":[\"Thriller\",\"Crime\",\"TV Movie\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":1149167,\"title\":\"High Rollers\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/hHowAaChDjwueySmwVbsjHmpWa.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/tsRtpoXBKWVe8B3qh3nqEjdq2Zj.jpg\",\"rating\":6.5,\"year\":2025,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"A master thief must pull off a dangerous casino heist when his nemesis kidnaps his lover. Caught between rival criminals and FBI pursuit, he risks all to save her and score big.\",\"genres\":[\"Action\",\"Crime\",\"Thriller\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":379170,\"title\":\"Sherlock: The Abominable Bride\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/hibE8cyZs2Bm0o4WaWd1pppvjO2.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/gGeoc8rFfPRIakXNttoFU85YVwv.jpg\",\"rating\":7.8,\"year\":2016,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Sherlock Holmes and Dr. Watson find themselves in 1890s London in this holiday special.\",\"genres\":[\"Crime\",\"Drama\",\"Mystery\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":336004,\"title\":\"Heist\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/eKdz5i9gbzJthAxUZBBj5SVbzKR.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/py92vTBXC2lpFXWvrvlDE9b6gU4.jpg\",\"rating\":6.1,\"year\":2015,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"A father is without the means to pay for his daughter's medical treatment. As a last resort, he partners with a greedy co-worker to rob a casino. When things go awry they're forced to hijack a city bus.\",\"genres\":[\"Action\",\"Crime\",\"Thriller\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":1075334,\"title\":\"The Girl Who Escaped: The Kara Robinson Story\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/o9hwOE1FeOelkNxfsGtTNrlWnyq.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/7SkhcQYU8mxGGCbmRbqOf6UFIuE.jpg\",\"rating\":7.1,\"year\":2023,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Based on a true story. 15-year-old Kara Robinson was kidnapped, assaulted and held captive for 18 hours. With her survival instincts kicking in, she plots a daring escape from the serial killer and leads police to his apartment.\",\"genres\":[\"Thriller\",\"Drama\",\"Crime\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":550776,\"title\":\"Believe Me: The Abduction of Lisa McVey\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/qbJEzCzEKDHPZDiRvSSBiYEKaAH.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/gPW90IPq6Go8hlT0n7Es3cFl7ly.jpg\",\"rating\":8,\"year\":2018,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"On the night she plans on taking her own life, 17-year-old 'Lisa McVey' is kidnapped and finds herself fighting to stay alive and is raped. She manages to talk her attacker into releasing her, but when she returns home, no one believes her story except for one detective, who suspects she was abducted by a serial killer. Based on horrifying true events.\",\"genres\":[\"Drama\",\"TV Movie\",\"Crime\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":363992,\"title\":\"The Wizard of Lies\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/8k4lJ4e0hvDQtKpItXmmPdw69sO.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/ims0V4WEUYt6JgfvPIyH9G79q40.jpg\",\"rating\":6.6,\"year\":2017,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"A look behind the scenes at Bernie Madoff's massive Ponzi scheme, how it was perpetrated on the public and the trail of destruction it left in its wake, both for the victims and Madoff's family.\",\"genres\":[\"Crime\",\"Drama\",\"TV Movie\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":1100795,\"title\":\"Mr. Monk's Last Case: A Monk Movie\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/gj74sUGsPMg5qDQooh8GTs4MvbP.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/AhmzDeQR3VF0Xp2dMVFPIOxNyFg.jpg\",\"rating\":6.8,\"year\":2023,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Monk steps out of retirement as his stepdaughter's wedding turns tragic when her fiancé dies in a bungee jumping accident.\",\"genres\":[\"Comedy\",\"Crime\",\"Mystery\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":336845,\"title\":\"Cleveland Abduction\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/j2iCc5fjyJvKRQAW7d6XWwDFzmr.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/lG8T8NMJHfBgxvobVBMy0rFR2OM.jpg\",\"rating\":7.3,\"year\":2015,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"A single mother becomes Ariel Castro's first kidnapping victim, and finds herself trapped in his home with two other women for 11 years.\",\"genres\":[\"Crime\",\"TV Movie\",\"Drama\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":457840,\"title\":\"Psych: The Movie\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/82Z6LEnkewH40pv6fa2Ci1CkSnd.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/fhajBJchq74U0KmVV1uSH6mMjxw.jpg\",\"rating\":7.3,\"year\":2017,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"The ambitious friends come together during the holidays after a mystery assailant targets one of their own. A comedic thrill-ride follows, as the wild and unpredictable Psych team pursues the bad guys, justice … and, of course, food!\",\"genres\":[\"Comedy\",\"Crime\",\"Mystery\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":361263,\"title\":\"Jesse Stone: Lost in Paradise\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/gw5ax5lElk0G1MRDFIQT4V8xUZU.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/4xAYXf0seFqQqItJ5qx20w78FlU.jpg\",\"rating\":6.6,\"year\":2015,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Police Chief Jesse Stone now presides over the quiet, seaside village of Paradise, Massachusetts. When the facts don't add up in a brutal Boston-area murder case, Jesse opens an investigation filled with surprises, unlikely suspects and grave danger. Though it's widely believed the murder was committed by an incarcerated serial killer, Jesse suspects another killer is at large and is hell-bent on bringing him to justice.\",\"genres\":[\"Drama\",\"TV Movie\",\"Crime\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":436398,\"title\":\"Dead Over Heels: An Aurora Teagarden Mystery\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/p6TUrrWS9R2pNGRw7NMw2cyLqkv.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/nyiE2ZAtgAAWscwK2mxstTt9Hri.jpg\",\"rating\":7,\"year\":2017,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Librarian and real crime buff Aurora “Roe” Teagarden never liked Detective Sergeant Jack Burns, but she also never wanted to see him dead. When his body is found outside of Aurora’s home, she then becomes  the main suspect. Determined to find the killer and clear her name, Aurora can't help but to get  involved once again.\",\"genres\":[\"Mystery\",\"TV Movie\",\"Crime\"],\"daysUntil\":null}],\"videos\":[{\"key\":\"oRzQ4zTVPuI\",\"name\":\"Official Trailer\",\"site\":\"YouTube\",\"type\":\"Trailer\"},{\"key\":\"vb5tj74g3y4\",\"name\":\"Official Trailer\",\"site\":\"YouTube\",\"type\":\"Trailer\"},{\"key\":\"3iijBOIcFIU\",\"name\":\"Official Trailer\",\"site\":\"YouTube\",\"type\":\"Trailer\"}],\"daysUntil\":null}","status":200,"url":""},"revalidate":86400,"tags":[]}